Let me see if I remember this vividly.

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:29.730
#1 was goal, goal is tied to a number.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:39.600
#2 is strategy #3 is deadline.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:48.100
#4 is your ask, your value, #5 is declaring
your intention and #6 is your execution.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:52.260
And then at the end is finding out when you
don't hit your goal what things to do, and

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:53.260
