00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:57.780
#1, identify the positives, identify the leaks,
how do you rank your strategy, how do you

00:17:57.780 --> 00:18:02.050
rank your level of execution, how would you
rank your effort from beginning to end, and

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:03.470
how urgent were you?

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:08.240
And if you take that approach with your goals,
you will start seeing better results because

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:12.120
it's all about improvement, and again, I don't
